"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ3YcHCHUoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ3IcHCHQoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["肥宅拉麵鄙視鏈的吠舍(大概吠舍與首陀之間),算是開啟台北大拉麵時代的始祖,第一間在台北東區,現已歇業,那時候吃屯京都要排隊呢.屯京算是對想嘗試日系拉麵的朋友很好的入門,個人只要有魚介的選項,幾乎九成都會點魚介.然後這次發現屯京有賣沾麵(記得以前沒有),就來嚐嚐看了(也是幾乎有沾麵就點沾麵),整體表現中歸中舉,麵條是用很一般的捲麵,不像鬼金棒 一燈 壹の穴都用比較粗且有咬勁的麵條,麵屋緣甚至用蕎麥,沾麵汁也比較水(沾麵汁其實都會弄得比較稠),不過魚介的濃厚度其實是夠的,麵條吸附湯汁效果佳是其優點,個人覺得其實蠻好吃的,不過叉燒跟溏心蛋就真的很普XDDD奶油菠菜好吃,屯京特色是有一些別家沒有的鐵板小菜,例如鐵板蛋液炸豬排,奶油蛤蠣,奶油菠菜,另外還有生菜沙拉,這比很多沒有蔬菜的拉麵店來說是其優點~如果你覺得大熱天不想在中山排知名拉麵店排到天荒地老,來屯京也不錯喔~而且樓上有四人桌,適合家庭來吃~",null,[0,174]]]],[],[null,null,2408,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWTFNYcG5NUzExZWpac1JEWnBjbnAwTmxOTlpHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x681a0464964fd86a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkVLSXpnMS11ejZsRDZpcnp0NlNNZGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWTFNYcG5NUzExZWpac1JEWnBjbnAwTmxOTlpHYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWTFNYcG5NUzExZWpac1JEWnBjbnAwTmxOTlpHYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWTFNYcG5NUzExZWpac1JEWnBjbnAwTmxOTlpHYxILMGU2T1JzS2JySV8aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rVkxTWHBuTVMxMWVqWnNSRFpwY25wME5sTk5aR2MSCzBlNk9Sc0ticklfIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARathPlmQEGmgqCzBlNk9Sc0ticklf\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQoykIdigK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjus5ryutKWAxWMeF4EHW_KDrYQ0pMFCBgoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ0pMFCGAoAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acFF6WkdOVWwyYURJd1NTMURhR1E1WkhkVGIyYxAB",["0x0:0x681a0464964fd86a",null,1775911058426453,1775911058426453,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103364508190861336117/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Ray Hsu","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeZQZ3NOCol9J1cBqbLAzst0xnBOFURmwkoh14GVvq4KT6ycigdg\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br1