對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ3YcHCJ4BKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ3IcHCJ0BKBU",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["以前是在東區吃屯京拉麵的回憶\n再次踏進屯京是中山這家\n空間明亮寬敞有兩層樓\n一樓是吧台，二樓是座位區及洗手間\n\n使用QRcode點餐\n中碗及大碗拉麵是同價格很佛\n湯頭及油量都可以選擇\n我們點了\n\n經典的屯京沙拉\n味噌沾麵\n奶油玉米味噌拉麵\n麻辣豚骨京蔥拉麵\n\n麵量很有誠意\n可以吃飽飽\n湯頭滿順口濃郁\n溏心蛋非常好吃\n麵Q彈是我喜歡的\n整體跟以前記憶中的屯京一樣好吃\n且店員都滿友善客氣的\n會再回訪👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻",null,[0,37]]]],[],[null,null,1878,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acFF6WkdOVWwyYURJd1NTMURhR1E1WkhkVGIyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x681a0464964fd86a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnZpQzZGNUl2aDIwSS1DaGQ5ZHdTb2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acFF6WkdOVWwyYURJd1NTMURhR1E1WkhkVGIyYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acFF6WkdOVWwyYURJd1NTMURhR1E1WkhkVGIyYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25acFF6WkdOVWwyYURJd1NTMURhR1E1WkhkVGIyYxILMGRxWjFIT1BtaGYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uWnBRelpHTlVsMmFESXdTUzFEYUdRNVpIZFRiMmMSCzBkcVoxSE9QbWhmIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARathPlmQEGmgqCzBkcVoxSE9QbWhm\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQoykInwEoFg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjus5ryutKWAxWMeF4EHW_KDrYQ0pMFCC8oAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68BHdVBCqAQ0pMFCHcoAg"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGM1dGTTVNME5FVEV0dmRISm1OVEJXZGtjdGIwRRAB",["0x0:0x681a0464964fd86a",null,1781171394868845,1781171394868845,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109627494529469387122/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["23 1","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2T-Z2S-X5teAUDRrZop0iPzKPPy6JpH8Otv0E7edkvuNM4vI\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109627494529469387122?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"109627494529469387122",null,9,8,null,[0,3,1],0,["9 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwiGipTyutKWAxW7k68B